  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea is that players can add more animations to their character, and be named as they please...\n\nHowever the feature added would be the ability for a world script to call upon any animation an avatar might have if they have an animation of that name, if the conditions are met\n\nAvatars could set up their own animations and could setup a naming convention themselves.\nAnimation names for starters:\n\"hit\" or \"hurt\"\n\"death\"\n\"victory\"\n\nThis could open up ideas for more advanced features, without enforcing a set amount of custom animations, as we currently have.  This could also open the door for more custom emotes and expression not available before.",
